        "punchlist": {
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2026-02-xx: Need to check ampacity of PMU feed wire, it looks undersized.\n2026-02-12: Resolved, The main feed cable to the PMU was missing. The small wire I was looking at is a feed from the PMU to the whole harness.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: Brakes don't fully return to off position.\n2026-04-01: Resolved after much work from Billy.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: The GUI doesn't fully boot, the screen flickers on and off continuously.\n2026-02-20: Resolved, the ribbon cable to the screen wasn't fully seated.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: HVIL is missing on the IMD box HV input / output.\n2026-02-20: Resolved, Billy added in the right jumper.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: The power steering is very noisy and doesn't idle when not in use.\n2026-03-23: Update, The power from the PMU to the steering sensor is wired wrong.\n2026-03-23: The steering angle sensor is not wired to PMU2 Output 11. Both \"ON\" and \"OFF\" have no effect on the pump noise.\n2026-04-02: Resolved, Billy fixed wiring.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "The APP only reaches 30%. Check wiring.\n2026-03-xx: Resolved, Channel A and Channel B were swapped.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Almost none of the outputs seem to turn on. Pumps not running.\n2026-02-17: Resolved, PMU1 and PMU2 calibrations were switched.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Vehicle gets CAN errors and the battery system doesn't wake.\n2026-02-16: Resolved, The rear harness extension was pinned with the wrong gender connector but still plugged in. Brandon re-pinned one side to the correct connector.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Vehicle doesn't PreCharge and get's negative contactor cross-check faults.\n2026-02-17: Resolved, The HVJB and CCS LV Connectors were swapped.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "12V was browing out. May have just been a super low 12V battery.\n2026-03-23: Resolved, Verified DCDC and hasn't happened since.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "At normal ignition standby you get a DCDCVoltXChk fault.\n2026-03-23: Resolved, Fault no longer showing up.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: When trying to charge you get a ChgPortContFlt.\n2026-04-15: Possibly fixed in new frimware expected by tomorrow.\n2026-04-17: Upgraded ChargeByte firmware and re-tested. Problem persists. The OBC isn't detecting pack voltage, need to check wiring and fuses to the OBC.\n2026-04-20: Resolved, Billy replaced the OBC fuse and charging now works as expected.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: Gear changes take pretty long.",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Ambient air temp sensor not reading correctly.\n2026-02-25: Resolved, Brandon found a pin with a bad crimp at the temp sensor.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-xx: Vehicle makes a shooshooshoo sound while driving. Doesn't seem to be related to brakes.\n2026-04-15: Might need a parking brake tune again, waiting on answer from Ampere about settings not allowed by VCU.",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-23: Cabin heat system needs commissioning.\n2026-04-01: Need to commission the heat system and remove the temp PMU logic.\n2026-04-15: Have new PMU program with logic ready, will need a few hours to install then verify.\n2026-04-20: The CAN based heater need's to be enabled in the VCU. Need to schedule a meeting to unlock this option which is currently behind a paywall structure.\n2026-04-21: Corrected VCU option to enable the heater. Need to make full climate controls schematic to answer questions needed to move on.",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-03-23: AC system needs commissioning.\n2026-03-31: AC works but condensate leaks onto the passenger's feet.\n2026-04-15: Resolved, Billy fixed the hose which had fallen off.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-04-01: Reverse lights don't seem to be working, it's likely wiring.\n2026-04-02: Resolved, Billy fixed wiring.\n2026-04-15: Driver side light burned out.",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-04-01: Getting a negative contactor welded fault in the VCU.\n2026-04-02: Resolved, negative contactor was welded and Billy replaced it.",
              "done": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Fix the gear ratio",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Battery type in preheim",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-07-28: Dakota Digital gauges need the limits modified / disabled to hide some nuisance alarms.",
              "done": false
            },
            {
              "text": "2026-07-28: The LDU has a cap on regen that needs to be removed.",
